        <p>It is very important to understand the program, its activities, its requirement, and our expectations of you. Please read this handbook closely and often to ensure that you are prepared to succeed in this exciting program. AT policy is subject to change. Please check the AT Student Handbook online, the AT portion of the website or with your academic advisor regularly for any updates.</p>
