      <p style="margin-top: 15px;">You will be required to take the ELI entrance assessment which will take place online through Zoom three weeks prior to your arrival. The assessment will not change your placement. We use this assessment to determine whether you need extra support with specific English skills.</p>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">CONTINUING ELI STUDENTS</h3>
    <div class="body-text">
      <p>Students who have studied in our Pre-AT curriculum will begin their AT program after meeting their Pre-AT requirements.</p>
